# A short recorded run, used by `make replay` and by CI.
#
# Times are milliseconds on the device clock, so a script replays identically
# on a fast laptop and a slow one: same seed + same script = same pixels.
# Note that the replay stops early if the game calls exitGame().

300   knob +2        # climb
700   press          # burn a boost
1200  knob -1
1800  knob -2        # dive back down
2400  press
3000  shot playing   # keep this frame in the filmstrip
3200  knob +3
4000  knob -4        # into the floor - ends the run
5200  shot gameover
5600  press          # play again
6500  theme 1        # switch palette mid-run: everything must repaint
7200  knob +1
8000  shot dark
9000  knob -2
11000 press
13000 knob +2
15000 shot late
